{"family": "rtmo", "task": "pose", "name": "RTMO", "plain": "OpenMMLab's RTMO (t, s, m, l): real-time one-stage multi-person 2D pose; finds people and their 17 COCO keypoints in one pass over the image, no person detector needed. Apache-2.0.", "summary": "RTMO (Lu et al. 2024): real-time one-stage multi-person 2D pose from OpenMMLab. A YOLOX-style CSPDarknet backbone, a hybrid encoder neck (one transformer layer on the coarsest map) and a head that predicts, per grid cell, a person score, a box and a pose vector; a dynamic coordinate classifier turns each kept pose vector into the 17 COCO keypoints over 1D bins that span the person's box. Takes the whole image without person boxes or a separate detector: the backbone runs once per image, while decoding and NMS depend on the detections. The image is letterboxed to 640 x 640 (416 x 416 for `rtmo-t`); vendored from mmpose (no mmpose / mmcv dependency). The portable `module()` maps the letterboxed image to the head's per-cell outputs (decoding and NMS stay outside).", "tier": "stable", "upstream": "https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmpose", "upstream_commit": "5408bc76f5b848cf925a0d1857899011d8c5b497", "original_is": null, "papers": [{"title": "RTMO: Towards High-Performance One-Stage Real-Time Multi-Person Pose Estimation", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07526", "date": "2023-12-12", "venue": "CVPR 2024", "variants": []}], "official": [], "modes": ["portable", "kernels"], "portable_dtype": "float16", "kernels_dtype": "float16", "kernel_libs": ["cudnn_hacc", "fvm_conv", "fvm_extra", "fvm_mb", "fvm_r3"], "mps_kernel_libs": [], "mps_dtypes": ["float32", "float16"], "no_kernels_reason": "", "options": [{"name": "score_threshold", "default": 0.1, "bounds": "0.0 to 1.0", "effect": "output"}], "outputs": [{"name": "keypoints", "extra": false}, {"name": "keypoint_scores", "extra": false}, {"name": "boxes", "extra": false}, {"name": "scores", "extra": false}], "output_info": {"label_set": "coco-keypoints-17"}, "licence_files": 